<div class="rte-content">
    <h3>UPCOMING ELECTION: November 3

Midterm General Election</h3>
</div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="umb-block-grid__layout-item"
            data-content-element-type-alias="richTextBlock"
            data-content-element-type-key="19516f22-0158-4aa2-99ea-1dba12af3446"
            data-element-udi="umb://element/ae2c0f8a88634919818508c84ed61a79"
            data-col-span="12"
            data-row-span="1"
            style=" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 12; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; ">
<div class="rte-content">
    <h3>VOTER REGISTRATION DEADLINE: October 9</h3>
<p style="text-align: left;">This is the last day to register to vote in time for the election. Any application postmarked by midnight on this date will be entered in time for the election.</p>
<p><strong>Register to vote:</strong></p>
<p>Use the <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://okvoterportal.okelections.us/Home/RegWizard" target="_blank" data-router-slot="disabled">OK Voter Registration Wizard</a></p>
<p>Paper applications are available at any Tag Agency or the <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/12000+E+Skelly+Dr,+Tulsa,+OK+74128/@36.1497413,-95.8460462,895m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x87b6f3111d04306f:0x5c6d9c1c70c627ef!8m2!3d36.149737!4d-95.8434713!16s%2Fg%2F11bw428vvn?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDIyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" title="Skelly Location" data-router-slot="disabled" data-anchor="?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDIyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D">Election Board Office</a></p>
<p><strong>Update voter registration:</strong></p>
<p>Voters who are already registered can update their address using the <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://okvoterportal.okelections.us/" target="_blank" data-router-slot="disabled">OK Voter Portal</a></p>
<p>More info about <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/voter-registration/register-to-vote.html" target="_blank" data-router-slot="disabled">Registering to vote in Oklahoma</a> </p>
<p> </p>
<h3>ABSENTEE BALLOT REQUEST DEADLINE: October 19</h3>
<p>Request an Absentee Ballot:</p>
<p>Use the <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://okvoterportal.okelections.us/" target="_blank" data-router-slot="disabled">OK Voter Portal</a> or</p>
<p>Submit a <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/absentee-ballots/absentee-ballot-application.pdf" target="_blank" title="Absentee Ballot Request Form_2026" data-router-slot="disabled">paper request</a> to the <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/12000+E+Skelly+Dr,+Tulsa,+OK+74128/@36.1497413,-95.8460462,895m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x87b6f3111d04306f:0x5c6d9c1c70c627ef!8m2!3d36.149737!4d-95.8434713!16s%2Fg%2F11bw428vvn?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDIyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" title="Skelly Location" data-router-slot="disabled" data-anchor="?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDIyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D">Election Board Office</a></p>
<p>More info about <a type="external" href="/electionboard/voting/absentee-voting/" data-router-slot="disabled">Absentee Voting</a></p>
<p> </p>
</div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="umb-block-grid__layout-item"
            data-content-element-type-alias="richTextBlock"
            data-content-element-type-key="19516f22-0158-4aa2-99ea-1dba12af3446"
            data-element-udi="umb://element/c957bc603bc54241b66b604eba68864d"
            data-col-span="12"
            data-row-span="1"
            style=" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 12; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; ">
<div class="rte-content">
    <h3>EARLY VOTING: October 28, 29, 30, 8am - 6pm; October 31, 8am - 2pm</h3>
<p>Early Voting for the November election will be held at four locations: the Tulsa County Election Board located at 12000 East Skelly Drive, Tulsa, OK 74128 (near 11th &amp; Garnett across from East Central High School) and the Tulsa Tech Center at 4000 West Florence in Broken Arrow, Chandler Park at 6500 West 21st Street, and O'Brien Park at 6149 North Lewis Avenue.</p>
<table border="0" style="min-width: 50px;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="p-3" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p class="text-center"><img class="img-responsive" src="/media/qajbdio0/skelly-location-map_early-voting.jpg" alt="skelly-location-map_early-voting" width="500" height="425"><br><a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tulsa+County+Election+Board/@36.1496388,-95.8469327,895m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x87b6eb9bf7b3860b:0xce1070f3b723053b!8m2!3d36.1496345!4d-95.8443578!16s%2Fg%2F1tnplj1c?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDQyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" title="Tulsa County Election Board Directions" data-router-slot="disabled" data-anchor="?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDQyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"><em>Tulsa County Election Board</em></a></p>
</td>
<td class="p-3" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p class="text-center"><img class="img-responsive" src="/media/1i5htq2g/tulsa-tech-center-map_1.jpg" alt="tulsa-tech-center-map_1" width="500" height="425"><br><a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tulsa+Tech+Center,+Broken+Arrow,+OK+74011/@36.0042104,-95.8399063,897m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x87b68ec281e2c453:0x14ffc5c90628d4b1!8m2!3d36.0042061!4d-95.8373314!16s%2Fg%2F1tgcsdcy?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDQyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" title="Directions to Tulsa Tech Center BA" data-router-slot="disabled" data-anchor="?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDQyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"><em>Tulsa Tech Center, Broken Arrow</em></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="p-3" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p class="text-center"><img class="img-responsive" src="/media/jpdp1kxb/chandler-park.jpg" alt="Chandler Park" width="500" height="425"> <br><a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/chandler+park/@36.1331507,-96.0700484,895m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" title="Chandler Park Directions" data-router-slot="disabled"><em>Chandler Park Community Center</em></a></p>
</td>
<td class="p-3" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p class="text-center"><img class="img-responsive" src="/media/g02frphg/obrien-park.jpg" alt="Obrien Park" width="500" height="425"> <br><a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/O'Brien+Park/@36.2453324,-95.9570503,894m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x87b6ef1ea47598ed:0xf9e53ce3366261f6!8m2!3d36.2453281!4d-95.9544754!16s%2Fg%2F1tdmk_h7?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" title="O’Brien Park Community Center" data-router-slot="disabled"><em>O’Brien Park Community Center</em></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="umb-block-grid__layout-item"
            data-content-element-type-alias="richTextBlock"
            data-content-element-type-key="19516f22-0158-4aa2-99ea-1dba12af3446"
            data-element-udi="umb://element/fb054d51c32243a38f89df544f505af3"
            data-col-span="12"
            data-row-span="1"
            style=" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 12; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; ">
<div class="rte-content">
    <p>Any registered voter in Tulsa County eligible to vote in the upcoming election can vote at early voting as long as they have not returned an absentee ballot. In order to vote, you must be registered in Tulsa County and have proper ID. You may show any ID issued by the United States, the State of Oklahoma, or a federally recognized tribal government if it includes your name, a photograph of you, and an expiration date that is later than the election in which you are voting. The free Voter Identification Card is also acceptable.</p>
<p> </p>
<h3>ABSENTEE BALLOT RETURN DEADLINES</h3>
<p>Mailed Absentee Ballots must be received by the Tulsa County Election Board by <strong>7 p.m. on Election Day </strong>to be counted. Hand-delivered Absentee Ballots must be received by <strong>5 p.m. on the day before the Election</strong> at the Tulsa County Election Board Office to be counted. Voters can ONLY HAND DELIVER THEIR OWN BALLOT AND MUST SHOW AN ID WHEN DELIVERING THEIR BALLOT.</p>
<p>With the passage of Senate Bill 376, as of November 1, 2023, Physically Incapacitated Absentee Ballots (Pink Affidavit Envelope) can be hand delivered.</p>
<p>More information about <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="/electionboard/voting/absentee-voting/" target="_blank" title="TC Absentee Voting" data-router-slot="disabled">Absentee Voting</a></p>
<p> </p>
<h3>ELECTION DAY: November 3</h3>
<p>On Election Day, polls are open from 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. Find your polling location and a sample ballot <a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/ovp.html" target="_blank" title="here">here</a><a rel="noopener" type="external" href="/media/11paoll2/polling-place-list_110326.pdf" target="_blank" title="Polling Place List November 2026"></a><a rel="noopener" type="external" href="https://okvoterportal.okelections.us/" target="_blank" data-router-slot="disabled"></a>. There is no voting at the Tulsa County Election Board on Election Day. You can also find a list of polling locations for the next Election <a rel="noopener" href="/media/11paoll2/polling-place-list_110326.pdf" target="_blank" title="Polling Place List November 2026">here</a>.</p>
</div>
        </div>
</div>

</div>

